      "text": "event type \n   title : interview\n   duration in minutes : 30\n   buffer before : 5\n   buffer after :  5\n\n\n\nrules:\n    mon :  9 am - 4 pm\n \n\nexceptions :\n     date : june 14 th monday    1 - 3 \n\n booked slots:\n        june 14 -   9:10 : 9:30 slot booked \n\n\nNow what logic we are gonna apply utilites to build\n",
