      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "function to merge intervals : \n\n9 - 4 slots to be created and\n1-3 exceptions\n\nso new windows are \n\n{9  - 1 } {3 - 4 }  so for such  more exceptions might gonna be joined ",
