    {
      "id": "498h2_fS9hYIGYQsvVBIJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 15601.9117455456,
      "y": 2129.0850811091786,
      "width": 1355.000122070313,
      "height": 1000,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0d",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1952850458,
      "version": 2080,
      "versionNonce": 370669318,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791059680569,
      "created": 1791051992596,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "we are creating a month slots:\n\na user created event and added rules with no exceptions\nmon - sunday we have different timings\n\n12 hour clock\n\nmon :  9 am to 6  pm\ntue :   12 am to 6 pm \nwed :   8 am to 8 pm\nthu :    2 pm to 6 pm\nfri  :    9 am to 6 pm\nsat :   9:30 am to 7:35 pm\nsun  :   9 am ot 9 pm\n\nThese are all rules added now we need to create slots based on that how we can create slots \n\n\nnow use this to create a slots for next 30 days : \n\nevent type added  and exceptions added  now what \n\nslot generation : \n\nafter event type created -> read rules -> and then what if no exceptoins are there  need to check   :\n    -  booked slots  x\n    -  exceptions x\n    -  event types v\n    -  rules v \n\n\nslot generation () :  \n    - startTime\n    - end Time\n    - duration in Minutes\n    - total Buffer in Minutes\n    - Date \n    - Day \n   -  rules of the day timings \n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "we are creating a month slots:\n\na user created event and added rules with no exceptions\nmon - sunday we have different timings\n\n12 hour clock\n\nmon :  9 am to 6  pm\ntue :   12 am to 6 pm \nwed :   8 am to 8 pm\nthu :    2 pm to 6 pm\nfri  :    9 am to 6 pm\nsat :   9:30 am to 7:35 pm\nsun  :   9 am ot 9 pm\n\nThese are all rules added now we need to create slots based on that how we can create slots \n\n\nnow use this to create a slots for next 30 days : \n\nevent type added  and exceptions added  now what \n\nslot generation : \n\nafter event type created -> read rules -> and then what if no exceptoins are there  need to check   :\n    -  booked slots  x\n    -  exceptions x\n    -  event types v\n    -  rules v \n\n\nslot generation () :  \n    - startTime\n    - end Time\n    - duration in Minutes\n    - total Buffer in Minutes\n    - Date \n    - Day \n   -  rules of the day timings \n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
