      "text": "subtract windows function:\n\n\nrule                \n{9:00 , 12:00 }\n\nexception\n {11:00, 12:00}\n\nnow are they overlapped true so next time window slot might be\n\n9  --> 11 which is smaller \n\n9 as startTime",
