      "text": "How overlapped  booked slots works ?\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How overlapped  booked slots works ?\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "j_uHOo4zMlIHek2fp1Oqp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 15350.489500252752,
      "y": 7162.292627400212,
      "width": 757.41943359375,
      "height": 325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b22",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1988317574,
      "version": 704,
      "versionNonce": 1239201050,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791112231608,
      "created": 1791112066860,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Take the current to be generated\n\nsubtract buffer before\nadd buffer after\n\nAs this slot would take  ( buffer before + duration in minutes + buffer after)\nso  now we have valid slot and later we compare whether this slots has\noverlapped or not if overlapped then we remove such a slot as \nslots already are overlapped.\n\n\nso thats makes sense actually in terms of actual progressions\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Take the current to be generated\n\nsubtract buffer before\nadd buffer after\n\nAs this slot would take  ( buffer before + duration in minutes + buffer after)\nso  now we have valid slot and later we compare whether this slots has\noverlapped or not if overlapped then we remove such a slot as \nslots already are overlapped.\n\n\nso thats makes sense actually in terms of actual progressions\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "iqPHqj2Tg_nscgjDrn8g1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 15160.581921733756,
