      "created": 1791165249451,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "writing slot generation on my own :\n\n\nuse promise.all to get all the details \n\nrules\nexceptions\nbookedslots\nevent types\n\nshall i call them all at once ? yep but  exceptions and bookedslots depends on\nthe to and from they are not existent we can't use them then  stuck at this\npoint\n\nsolution to this : just logically check if to and from then proceed",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "writing slot generation on my own :\n\n\nuse promise.all to get all the details \n\nrules\nexceptions\nbookedslots\nevent types\n\nshall i call them all at once ? yep but  exceptions and bookedslots depends on the to and from they are not existent we can't use them then  stuck at this point\n\nsolution to this : just logically check if to and from then proceed",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
