      "updated": 1791715503798,
      "created": 1791169324507,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\nworking on slot dto: \n\n\nDo we really need any  use that we gonna update slot individually like \n - update a single slot  - might be we need to update the slot \n\nmy  doubt :  will create a  update slot DTO  \n\nrepo layer : when updating a single dto what are fields that i should make as optional and what logic on  refine should i put ?\n\nit should always be having event type and hostid these are mandatory field\noptional are then \n\njust status is optional or startType and endType can i make it optional \n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\nworking on slot dto: \n\n\nDo we really need any  use that we gonna update slot individually like \n - update a single slot  - might be we need to update the slot \n\nmy  doubt :  will create a  update slot DTO  \n\nrepo layer : when updating a single dto what are fields that i should make as optional and what logic on  refine should i put ?\n\nit should always be having event type and hostid these are mandatory field\noptional are then \n\njust status is optional or startType and endType can i make it optional \n",
      "autoResize": false,
